  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag avser st&#xf6;d till svenska Justitieombudsmannen avseende resa till Makedonien. Syftet med resa &#xe4;r att ta reda p&#xe5; f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r eventuellt svenskt bilateralt st&#xf6;d till makedonska ombudsmannen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The financial support is allocated to the Swedish Parliamentary Ombudsman Office for a fact finding mission in Macedonia. The purpose of the mission is to elaborate the possibilities for Swedish support towards the Macedonian Ombudsman Office.</narrative>
  </description>
